{"title":"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/d/60dbb10b58e759815d91a699cdd65cd5451eaeae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a_n)_{n \\geq 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> be a sequence such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b1171ce641826e9aca894162f9c15a57f6b46e09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"49\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/0/6c0925f694d6a6e3580f8a1b2eab0f8ef9e1abfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a_{n+1} - 3a_n = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd51809cda6a8a4c5d96f49d71e4092af366ba8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/1/2e18df509c9fd75d7cd28d2800a1d0a118b1d0c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2002}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/1/3713d8938981d556373aedfed9ef4681e6cb7a20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }666 \\qquad \\text{(B) }667 \\qquad \\text{(C) }668 \\qquad \\text{(D) }669 \\qquad \\text{(E) }670$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The recursive rule is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/4/e5444c73c246fb36b236035fbd7234204c6e2c5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{3}+a_{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"38\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/5/dd51809cda6a8a4c5d96f49d71e4092af366ba8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> By recursion, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/e/7eecc07e76de8fad5447ec2ed65c76e87c6b3380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n+2}=\\frac{1}{3}+a_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{3}+a_n=\\frac{1}{3}(2)+a_n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"352\" height=\"38\" /> If we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/9/1d96ecc15129c5631ba4a2c6578e91e3d13e3baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and repeat this process <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7e2da81334aad3aeeb09706fed72248196613b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2001$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> times, we will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/a/abad273f1216e2ebe1c6ccd58e25e679067bf0ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2001+1}=a_{2002}=\\frac{1}{3}(2001) + a_1=667+1=668.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"383\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97cbdc21693ad542fe9dce6bfe46de4dd52a5b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 668}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the first few terms of the sequence and find a pattern.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78c76590702527f372cfab88f1128d88262082f1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{tabular}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|}  \\hline   n &amp; 1 &amp; 2 &amp; 3 &amp; 4 &amp; 5 \\\\   \\hline  an &amp; 1 &amp; 4/3 &amp; 5/3 &amp; 2 &amp; 7/3 \\\\  \\hline \\end{tabular}\\]\" width=\"229\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p>From here, we can deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/9/a797c524280ad80dc592088052c38dee2a12c148.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n=\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{1}{3}n.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" /> Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/7/4a7b466011fb45f7179ca44093197c786da420ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=2002,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3621013172690e52493bdfc89e4e8b5a50ece48a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{2002}=\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{2002}{3}=668.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"195\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/c/97cbdc21693ad542fe9dce6bfe46de4dd52a5b2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 668}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P\">2002 AMC 10P</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10P_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 10P Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_1